@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam classBorderColor #6C757D
skinparam arrowColor #495057
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

actor "User A" as UserA
actor "User B" as UserB
participant "Frontend\n(Three-Panel Editor)" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as Backend
participant Liveblocks
participant "AI Doc Service" as AIDoc
participant "AI Provider" as Provider
database Database

== AI Chat Refinement ==
UserA -> Frontend : Type message in AI chat panel
Frontend -> Backend : POST /chat/threads/{thread_id}/messages/stream
Backend -> Database : Save user ChatMessage
Backend -> Database : Load thread, history, project resources
Backend -> AIDoc : stream_chat(thread, messages, provider, model, resources)
AIDoc -> AIDoc : Build chat prompt with project context
AIDoc -> Provider : Streaming AI call or complete_text fallback
Provider --> AIDoc : Text chunks
AIDoc --> Backend : SSE data events
Backend --> Frontend : text/event-stream
Frontend --> UserA : Render streamed tokens
AIDoc -> Database : Save AI ChatMessage on completion
opt User applies suggestion
  UserA -> Frontend : Apply suggestion to section editor
end

== Accept AI Suggestion ==
UserA -> Frontend : Click Accept on generated/refined content
Frontend -> Backend : PATCH /sections/{section_id}
Backend -> Database : Update Section.content_md
Backend -> Database : Create SectionVersion(author_type=USER)
Backend -> Database : Update content_lifecycle as generated draft
Backend --> Frontend : Updated Section

== Real-Time Collaborative Editing ==
UserA -> Frontend : Open section
Frontend -> Frontend : Derive room id\nproject:{project_id}:document:{document_id}:section:{section_id}
Frontend -> Backend : POST /projects/{project_id}/documents/{document_id}/sections/{section_id}/collaboration/auth
Backend -> Database : Verify project membership
Backend -> Database : Verify document access and section ownership
Backend -> Database : Resolve effective permission(view/comment/edit)
Backend -> Backend : Map permission to Liveblocks access
Backend -> Liveblocks : POST /v2/authorize-user with secret key
Liveblocks --> Backend : Token response
Backend --> Frontend : Liveblocks token
Frontend -> Liveblocks : Connect to section room

UserB -> Frontend : Open same section
Frontend -> Backend : POST /projects/{project_id}/documents/{document_id}/sections/{section_id}/collaboration/auth
Backend -> Database : Repeat membership, access, permission checks
Backend -> Liveblocks : POST /v2/authorize-user with secret key
Liveblocks --> Backend : Token response
Backend --> Frontend : Liveblocks token
Frontend -> Liveblocks : Join same section room
Liveblocks --> Frontend : Presence and cursor updates for both users
UserB -> Frontend : Edit content
Frontend -> Liveblocks : Yjs CRDT update
Liveblocks --> Frontend : Sync update to User A editor
Frontend --> UserA : Editors converge

... debounced collaborative snapshot ...
Frontend -> Frontend : Convert Tiptap/Yjs state to Markdown
Frontend -> Backend : PATCH /projects/{project_id}/documents/{document_id}/sections/{section_id}/collaboration/snapshot
Backend -> Database : Check effective EDIT permission
Backend -> Database : Check Document.status != APPROVED
Backend -> Database : Update Section.content_md and updated_at
Backend -> Database : Update Document.updated_at
Backend -> Backend : clear_review_state_for_content_edit()
Backend --> Frontend : SectionAutosaveResponse

note right of Database
The collaboration snapshot endpoint persists Markdown and clears review state.
The current implementation does not add a Liveblocks-specific PostgreSQL table.
end note

== Section Review ==
UserA -> Frontend : Click Accept Review
Frontend -> Backend : POST /sections/{section_id}/accept-review
Backend -> Database : Set content_lifecycle=REVIEWED
Backend -> Database : Record reviewed_by and reviewed_at
Backend -> Database : Record reviewed_against_analysis_id
Backend --> Frontend : Updated Section
@enduml
